\textbf{Problem:} Find the sum of the digits of the base-8 expression for $8888_{10}$. 
\textbf{Solution:} 
We want to convert $8888_{10}$ to base-8. We repeatedly divide by 8 and keep track of the remainders. 
\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ remainder } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ remainder } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ remainder } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ remainder } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ remainder } 2 \end{align*} 
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we have $8888_{10} = 21270_8$. 
The sum of the digits is $2 + 1 + 2 + 7 + 0 = 12$. 

\boxed{12} 
